    "https://belmontabbeycollege.edu/academics/career-services/": {
      "title": "Career Services & Internships",
      "description": "Career Services & Internships - Belmont Abbey College Skip to main content Academics Academics Academics Undergraduate Graduate Honors College Faculty Calendar Abbey Online Academic Resources Belmont Abbey College The Catholic College of the South VISIT Academics Admissions APPLY GET INFO My abbey GIVE Career Services & Internships Home > Academics > Career Services Career services & Internships Helping you reach your career goals We strive to provide the tools needed for a long, successful, and satisfying career. That’s why we assist students and alumni with crucial skills that range from resume writing to personal assessments. We also form strong bonds with our employer programs to foster lasting relationships that benefit all involved. Learn MORE Real-world Experience Your Abbey experience will include accessibility to internships where you’ll put your classroom knowledge into action. We partner with amazing companies and programs that frequently hire Abbey interns after graduation. EXPLORE IT ALL Alumni Success Stories WHAT DID THE ABBEY DO FOR YOU? Leondra Stewart 2014 Financial Services Officer, SECU EMMA CAMP 2006 Coral Scientist and National Geographic Explorer CLAY DIMICK 2017 Professional soccer player, Charlotte Independence Where Some of Our Recent Graduates Are Currently Employed Employers Wanted HOST AN INTERNSHIP RECRUIT ON CAMPUS POST TO THE JOB BOARD Schedule a Visit We would love to show you around our beautiful campus and discuss your college plans! Come meet us! GET STARTED Contact 100 Belmont-Mt. Holly Road Belmont, NC 28012 ADMISSIONS: 1-888-222-0110 FINANCIAL AID: 1-704-461-7000 MAIN NUMBER: 1-704-461-6700 FAX: 704-461-6220 info@bac.edu Quick Links DIRECTIONS TO THE COLLEGE SUPPORT THE COLLEGE TITLE IX CAMPUS DIRECTORY BELMONT ABBEY MONASTERY THE CATHOLIC SHOPPE CAMPUS SAFETY COLLEGE BOOKSTORE PRESS INQUIRIES ADMISSION INFORMATION VISIT CAMPUS MAP EMPLOYMENT OPPORTUNITIES PERFORMING ARTS 100 Belmont-Mt. Holly Road Belmont